  headerText: SAPLAVI EXPLOSION LEAVES TOWN UNDER STRICT QUARANTINE
  subheaderText: AUTHORITIES ESTABLISH CONTROL ZONE
  descriptionText: Following a reported industrial explosion near Saplavi, authorities
    have enacted strict quarantine procedures. Residents are instructed to remain
